title: 'cumulus: refactor slot based builder loop'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: 
    Splits the slot-based collator's block-builder loop into per-slot phases
    (`prepare_slot`/`plan_cores` on a `BuilderEnv`), extracts small helpers,
    and fixes one edge case: when the parent search ran with V3 scheduling
    params but the context re-derived to V2 at the build parent, the included
    head is now re-fetched at the relay parent instead of reusing a stale
    snapshot.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-aura
  bump: patch
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-common
  bump: patch
